{"product_id":"blvk-unicorn-nicotine-salt-honeydew","title":"BLVK Unicorn Nicotine Salt - Honeydew","description":"\u003cp\u003eHoneydew Nicotine Salt by BLVK Unicorn presents juicy honeydew melon chunks combined with a plethora of mixed berries for a flavor explosion.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eBLVK Unicorn SALT - Honeydew Features:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30mL Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Salts Formulation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCrafted For Ultra-Low Wattage \u0026amp; Pod-Based System\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine: 35mg, 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWarning:\u003c\/strong\u003e This product is not meant for use in devices that reach sub-ohm resistance. We recommend this liquid to be used in pod-based, closed systems devices, and ultra low-output atomizers\/mods. Every salt-based nicotine e-juice contains significantly higher levels of nicotine per milliliter, optimal for beginners or experienced vapers looking for a travel-friendly experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"BLVK","offers":[{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41670548160567,"sku":"BLVK - Honeydew 35 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670548193335,"sku":"BLVK - Honeydew 50 mg","price":1650.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/blvk_unicorn_-_salt_series_-_salts_-_honeydew_-_box_bottle.png?v=1747708428","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/blvk-unicorn-nicotine-salt-honeydew","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




